---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Advisory & Consulting" 
  description="Architecture advisory, identity platform migrations, and agentic AI execution boundary reviews with Viswaroop Vadlamudi."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-6 md:py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)]">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--accent)] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Advisory & Advisory Services</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold font-heading text-[var(--text-primary)] mt-1 mb-3">A Second Pair of Eyes</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        I work with engineering leaders and platform teams thinking through complex infrastructure, open-source IAM transitions, and the blast-radius boundaries of autonomous AI workflows.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      
      <!-- Service 1 -->
      <section class="craft-card p-6 md:p-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--accent)] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">01 / Identity</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] font-heading mt-1 mb-3">Identity Platform Migration</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          For teams evaluating an open-source identity stack (ORY Hydra / Kratos / Keto, Keycloak, or Auth0 replacements) or planning a multi-tenant transition without downtime.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-6 list-none pl-0">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">✓</span> Migration sequencing and zero-downtime cutover strategy</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">✓</span> Multi-tenant isolation and OAuth2 token flow modeling</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">✓</span> Decoupling authentication from Zanzibar relationship permissions</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:hello@viswaroop.dev?subject=Identity%20Platform%20Migration%20Inquiry" class="btn-primary text-xs">
          Start a conversation ↗
        </a>
      </section>

      <!-- Service 2 -->
      <section class="craft-card p-6 md:p-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--accent)] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">02 / Platforms</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] font-heading mt-1 mb-3">Multi-Cloud Platform Advisory</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          For teams tackling Kubernetes sprawl, multi-cluster delivery friction, or building golden paths across AWS EKS and GCP GKE with GitOps.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-6 list-none pl-0">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">✓</span> Standardized GitOps delivery with Argo CD and Kustomize</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">✓</span> Blast-radius aligned promotion pipelines and risk tiering</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">✓</span> Operational readiness, SLO guardrails, and incident runbooks</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:hello@viswaroop.dev?subject=Platform%20Engineering%20Advisory%20Inquiry" class="btn-primary text-xs">
          Talk through your platform ↗
        </a>
      </section>

      <!-- Service 3 -->
      <section class="craft-card p-6 md:p-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--accent)] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">03 / Agentic AI</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] font-heading mt-1 mb-3">Agentic AI Execution Review</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          For teams building software where AI agents act autonomously on behalf of users, requiring strict limits on authority, delegated tokens, and execution sandboxes.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-6 list-none pl-0">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">✓</span> OAuth2 machine-to-machine delegation & ephemeral token lifecycles</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">✓</span> Zanzibar-style relationship checks for autonomous tools</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--accent)]">✓</span> Execution isolation and zero-trust sandbox architecture</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:hello@viswaroop.dev?subject=Agentic%20AI%20Architecture%20Inquiry" class="btn-primary text-xs">
          Share what you're building ↗
        </a>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
